  It turns out this repository defines =files=, =values=, =utils= etc. in a
  =nixosModules= output, but you can just have them be top-level attributes of
  the output. There's nothing special about =nixosModules=, and these things
  aren't really modules, are they? Some are just constants, others are more
  like a =lib=.

